      "year": 2023,
      "abstract": "The purpose of this article is to reconstruct and analyse the views on the issues of war that appear in John Rawls\u2019 doctrine of the law of peoples. To some extent, it also aims to evaluate this doctrine in terms of its relevance to contemporary problems. The aim is to determine whether it has the potential to generate effective political action based on clear normative criteria. It thus takes the opportunity to indicate which elements of the doctrine need to be refined or modified if it is to fulfil the tasks set before it. The publication also answers the question of what place war has in Rawls\u2019s doctrine of the law of peoples and how its conduct is regulated.",
